<!--
    1) bin/product.conf exists
    2) bin/product.conf has a slot property with a value equal to the value of the
       'full.dist.product.slot' property
    3) jboss-modules.jar must exist
    4) standalone/configuration/standalone.xml must exist
    5) modules/system/layers/base/org/jboss/as/product/${full.dist.product.slot}/wildfly-feature-pack-product-conf-${full.maven.version}.jar exists
    6) Various modules provided by the feature-pack that provides the complete MicroProfile feature set are present
    7) Schemas coming from a module distributed directly by the galleon-pack are copied to docs/schema
    8) Schemas coming from a module distributed by the transitive ee-galleon-pack are copied to docs/schema
    9) Schemas coming from a module formerly distributed by the transitive servlet-galleon-pack are copied to docs/schema
   10) Schemas coming from a module formerly distributed by the transitive core-galleon-pack are copied to docs/schema
   11) the .galleon dir exists
   12) no .galleon/history dir exists
   13) the .installation dir exists and contains channel metadata
   14) version.txt exists
   15) Verify that installation manager helper files are provisioned at .installation directory
   16) JBossEULA.txt exists
   17) copyright.txt does not exist
   18) README.txt does not exist
   19) docs/contrib does not exist
   20) Some verifications around libartemis-native-32.so / libartemis-native-64.so to ensure the server distribution
       contains the -64 variant and does not contain the -32 one.
   21) modules/layers.conf contains layers=microprofile
   22) Some Netty Linux native dependency verifications
-->
